  "limitations": [
    "Deterministic CPU BVH; 3 diffuse bounces. SH stores cosine-convolved irradiance E; Lambert use E/PI.",
    "Actual geometry occludes every light/environment ray. Visibility/depth moments are camera independent. Straight thin-sheet transmission includes Fresnel and Beer attenuation; solid refraction and caustics are not solved.",
    "Irradiance includes visibility-filtered environment and bounced surface radiance, but no directly sampled delta lights at probes. Keep analytic direct lighting separate. Local reflection images are linear radiance, without exposure/tone mapping.",
    "Finite sun disks and projected point/spot source disks are sampled when authored; zero-size sources retain delta-light behavior. Rectangular sources sample their full area.",
    "The solver traces diffuse transport and local HDR captures; it does not solve glossy interreflection, caustics or moving geometry. Material-layer energy attenuation is an approximation for diffuse bounce transport."
  ],
